(text "POWER: one 2 mm cap, 1-2=5 V or 2-3=12 V; no cap=off.\nBIAS: 1k pull-up to internal 3.3 V through PMOS/diode; 10k pull-down through 60 V NMOS.\nBoth gates return OFF during reset. Software selects UP / DOWN / OFF / FLOAT / KEEPER. No bias bridges." (at 15 127 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b73e13de-0f58-5f19-82fd-c16117009eb6"))
